{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Last Presence</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game with an Arabic theme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as <strong>Raheem</strong>, who returns to his childhood home after having strange dreams and hearing rumors that his grandmother might still be alive, even though she was declared dead years ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As Raheem explores the house, he finds it empty\u2026 but something is not right. Strange puzzles appear, and he starts doing things without meaning to, as if someone else is controlling him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features a unique story, Arabic-inspired setting, and symbolic puzzles. But in the end, Raheem is not just visiting the house, he might never leave it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784810/extras/LastPresence_SteamGIF_Loop.gif?t=1749829373\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3784810?t=1749829373","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784810/8062a3891c663948ebc726dd8f386fee01610b7b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749829373","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784810/01f589020296be8826f7b7fa9f11f1f0d8793fcb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749829373","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784810/01f589020296be8826f7b7fa9f11f1f0d8793fcb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749829373","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Last Presence</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game with an Arabic theme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as <strong>Ra